        engineeringData: { blockDesign: "Inline-4, Aluminum block with cast-iron cylinder liners. The M 166 engine was designed specifically for the W168 A-Class and its revolutionary 'sandwich floor' concept. The engine is tilted forward at a severe 59-degree angle. In the event of a severe frontal impact, the engine and transmission are designed to slide underneath the passenger compartment rather than intruding into the cabin. This maximizes safety in a tiny car but makes maintenance an absolute nightmare.", crankshaft: "Cast Iron, supported by 5 main bearings. Balanced for smooth low-RPM operation.", pistonSpeed: "13.5 m/s @ 5000 RPM.", alternator: "90A or 120A Bosch/Valeo (Buried at the bottom of the engine bay).", rotatingAssembly: { pistonConstruction: "Cast aluminum alloy.", wristPinDiameter: "20 mm.", connectingRodLength: "138 mm.", rodBoltSize: "M8.", crankMainJournal: "50.0 mm.", crankRodJournal: "45.0 mm.", rodRatio: "1.65." }, cylinderHead: { combustionChamberVol: "Wedge-shaped combustion chamber.", intakePortFlow: "8-valve SOHC design. Utilizing only two valves per cylinder and a single overhead camshaft, the cylinder head is designed for extreme simplicity, packaging efficiency, and low-end torque rather than high-RPM breathing.", valveSizes: "Intake: 34.0 mm / Exhaust: 31.0 mm.", valveStemDiameter: "6.0 mm.", camshaftDuration: "Mild profile optimized for urban driving and fuel economy.", lifterType: "Hydraulic bucket tappets.", specialFeature: "Integrated ECU/MAF & Sandwich Architecture. The most defining engineering trait of this powertrain is its packaging. The combined ECU and throttle body module sits directly atop the intake manifold to save space. The engine's extreme tilt means that the starter motor, steering rack, and alternator are incredibly difficult to reach without dropping the front subframe, making it one of the most frustrating vehicles for mechanics to service." }, oilAndCooling: { oilSquirters: "None.", oilPumpType: "Chain-driven gerotor pump.", thermostatOpening: "87°C Mechanical thermostat.", oilCooler: "None." }, fuelSystem: { systemType: "Bosch Multi-Point Manifold Injection.", maxPressure: "3.5 Bar.", injectors: "4x Standard Solenoid Injectors." }, tuningLimits: { maxSafeTorqueStock: "200 Nm", maxSafePowerStock: "150 hp (The block is strong enough, but the 8-valve head and restricted displacement make tuning completely futile. The integrated ECU makes forced induction nearly impossible to map).", maxSafeRPM: "6000 RPM", weakestLink: "Integrated ECU/MAF unit (Fails from heat/vibration), Starter Motor Access (Labor cost exceeds car value), Rear Trailing Arm Bearings (Rust and collapse)." }, electrical: { coils: "Wasted spark ignition coil pack module.", ecu: "VDO / Bosch Integrated MAF/Throttle/ECU module (Highly prone to failure)." } },
